    rdfs:comment """RecruitmentInterviewScheduling lies below Purpose through a six-step hierarchy: RecruitmentInterviewManagement, RecruitmentManagement, PersonnelHiring, PersonnelManagement, and HumanResourceManagement. All six relations are published by DPV."""@en ;
